          %p#References
            %strong References
          %p Pointers to the literature are given in each chapter, alongside the text. The following is a selection of these references.
          %p
            The discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spinors"} spinors
            in chapter
            %em
              %a{:href => "#Spacetime"} 2. Spacetime
            follows
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "spin+representation#BaezHuerta09"} Baez-Huerta 09
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functorial+geometry"} functorial geometry
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergeometry"} supergeometric
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spaces+of+field+histories"} spaces of field histories
            in
            %em
              %a{:href => "#Fields"} 3. Fields
            follows
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "higher+prequantum+geometry#Schreiber13"} Schreiber 13
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "smooth+set#GiotopoulosSati23"} Giotopoulos &amp; Sati 2023
          %p
