            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "local+BRST+cohomology#BarnichBrandtHenneaux00"} Barnich-Brandt-Henneaux 00
          %p
            For the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+fixing"} BV-gauge fixing
            developed in
            %em
              %a{:href => "#GaugeFixing"} 12. Gauge fixing
            we take clues from
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "BV-BRST+formalism#FredenhagenRejzner11a"} Fredenhagen-Rejzner 11a
          %p
