                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} abstractly
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback+of+differential+forms"} pullback of differential 1-forms
                makes the assignment of sets of differential 1-forms to
