                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Omega^1(\mathbb{R}^k)
                of smooth 1-forms.
              %p
                We write
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
