                      %mo →
                      %mi U
                      %mo ′
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U \to U'
                and therefore this says that
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
