              %p
                This defines a bigrading on the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/de+Rham+complex"} de Rham complex
                of
                = succeed "," do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
