                      \\left(
                      j^\infty_\Sigma(A)
                      \\right)^\ast(f_{\mu \nu})
                      \&amp; =
                      (d A)_{\mu \nu}
                      \\\
                      \&amp; = F_{\mu \nu}
                      \\end{aligned}
              %p
                It follows that the pullback of the Lagrangian
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:ElectromagnetismLagrangian"} (43)
                along the jet prologation of the electromagnetic field is
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mrow
