                from example
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ElectromagnetismLagrangianDensity"}
              %p
                The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euler-Lagrange+variational+derivative"} Euler-Lagrange variational derivative
                is
              #eq:ElectromagneticFieldEulerLagrangeForm.maruku-equation
                %span.maruku-eq-number (64)
