              %p
                By theorem
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LinearObservablesForGreeFreeFieldTheoryAreDistributionalSolutionsToTheEquationsOfMotion"}
                we have the identification
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:LinearDualOfSolutionSpaceIsLinearDualOfFullSpaceModuloImageOfDifferentialOperator"} (100)
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:LinearOnShellObservablesAreLinearOffShellobservableModuloTheEquationsOfMotion"} (101)
              #eq:RegularLinearObservablesAreCompactlySupportedSectionsModuloImageOfP.maruku-equation
                %span.maruku-eq-number (104)
