                assigns the observable which is the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+observable"} field observable
                smeared by (i.e. averaged against) that smearing function.
              %p
                Below in
                %em
                  %a{:href => "#FreeQuantumFields"} Free quantum fields
                we discuss how the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/polynomial+Poisson+algebra"} polynomial Poisson algebra
                of regular polynomial observables of a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+field+theory"} free field theory
                may be
