                in the following way:
              %ol
                %li
                  %p
                    On variational forms that are in the image of the total spacetime derivative a transgressive variant of the
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stokes%27+theorem"} Stokes' theorem
                    (prop.
                    = succeed ")" do
                      %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#StokesTheorem"}
                  .maruku-equation
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
