                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Sigma \times \{\varphi\} \hookrightarrow \mathcal{E}
                be a constant section of the shell
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:ConstantSectionOfTrivialShellBundle"} (59)
                as in example
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ShellForSpacetimeIndependentLagrangians"}
              %p Then we write
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
