              %p Explicitly, this means the following:
              %p
                First of all, by prop.
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#JetBundleIsLocallyProManifold"}
                the dependence of the Lagrangian density
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                        %mi L
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{L}
                on the order of field derivatives is bounded by some
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi k
