                      %mi φ
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \varphi
                and hence, by the spacetime independence of
                = succeed "," do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
