              %p
                By example
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FourierTransformOfDistributionsIndeedGeneralizedOrdinaryFourierTransform"}
                the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fourier+transform+of+distributions"} distributional Fourier transform
