                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy%27s+integral+formula"} Cauchy's integral formula
                    to find in the case
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
