                      \\,.
              %p
                With this, the statement follows immediately from prop.
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FourierTransformOfPrincipalValueOfPowerOfQuadraticForm"}
            #WaveFronSetsForKGPropagatorsOnMinkowski.num_prop
              %h6#proposition_32 Proposition
              %p
