                    %mi d
                    %mi S
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d S
              should be a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/section"} section
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cotangent+bundle"} cotangent bundle
              of the Lie algebroid. Moreover, if all field variations are infinitesimal (as in def.
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LocalObservablesOnInfinitesimalNeighbourhood"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+neighbourhood"} infinitesimal neighbourhood
