                has been defined on generators, it is uniquely a homomorphism of graded algebras. It is clear that if
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mi d
                      %mi S
                      %msup
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %mo *
