            #BasicPropertiesOfTheLocalAntibracket.num_prop
              %h6#proposition_5 Proposition
              %p
                %strong
                  (basic properties of the
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+antibracket"} local antibracket
              %p
                The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+antibracket"} local antibracket
                from def.
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LocalAntibracket"}
                satisfies the following properties:
              %ol
                %li
                  %p
                    The two versions differ by a
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/total+spacetime+derivative"} total spacetime derivative
                    (def.
                    = succeed "):" do
                      %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#VariationalBicomplexOnSecondOrderJetBundleOverTrivialVectorBundleOverMinkowskiSpacetime"}
                  .maruku-equation
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
