                %a{:href => "local+BRST+cohomology#BarnichHenneaux96"}> Barnich-Henneaux 96 (B.9)
                ).
              %p
                Finally that
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
