            %p
              The local refinement of prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ExteriorDifferentialOfGaugeInvariantFunctionIsSectionOfInfinitesimalCotangentLieAlgebroid"}
              is now this:
            #EulerLagrangeFormIsSectionOfLocalCotangentBundleOfJetBundleGaugeActionLieAlgebroid.num_prop
              %h6#proposition_6 Proposition
              %p
                %strong
