              %p
                and as such is a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derivation"} derivation
                not only for the pointwise product, but also for the product in the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wick+algebra"} Wick algebra
                (the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/star+product"} star product
                induced by the
                = succeed "):" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wightman+propagator"} Wightman propagator
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
