                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P^\ast
                retains or shrinks the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/wave+front+set"} wave front set
                of the distributional coefficient, hence it preserves the microcausality condition (def.
                = succeed ")." do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#MicrocausalObservable"}
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
                      %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                      %mi S
                      %mo ′
                      %mo ,
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{-S',(-)\}
                restrict to microcausal polynomial observables.
              %p
                To see that
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
                      %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                      %mi S
                      %mo ′
                      %mo ,
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{-S',(-)\}
                thus restricted is a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derivation"} derivation
                of the Wick algebra product, it is sufficient to see that its
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commutators"} commutators
                with the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wightman+propagator"} Wightman propagator
                vanish in each argument:
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
