          %div
            %h2#QuantumObservables Interacting quantum fields
            %p In this chapter we discuss the following topics:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "#FreeFieldVacua"} Free field vacua
              %li
                %p
                  %em
