                    (say the
                    = succeed ")" do
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/electron-photon+interaction"} electron-photon interaction
                    %em really
                    supposed to vanish outside a compact region of spacetime. In order to reflect this mathematically, one may consider a
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sequence"} sequence
                    of
