              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/interacting+field+observables"} interacting field observables
              which are induced from an
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/S-matrix"} S-matrix
              enjoy good properties expected of any abstractly defined
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/perturbative+algebraic+quantum+field+theory"} perturbative algebraic quantum field theory
            %p
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \,
            #QuntumMollerOperator.num_defn
