              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#InteractingFieldAlgebraOfObservablesIsFormalDeformationQuantization"}
              says that this is nevertheless the case. (The special case of this statement for
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+field+theory"} free field theory
              is discussed at
              = succeed "," do
