                  %p
                    (sending any
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/edge"} edge
                    to the unordered pair of distinct
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vertices"} vertices
                    that it goes between).
              %p
                A choice of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+order"} linear order
                on the set of vertices of a finite multigraph is a choice of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bijection"} bijection
                of the form
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
