                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                      V \simeq \{1, 2, \cdots, \nu\}
                      \\,.
              %p
                Hence the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphism+classes"} isomorphism classes
                of a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+graph"} finite
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/multigraphs"} multigraphs
                with
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+order"} linearly ordered
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vertices"} vertices
                are characterized by
              %ol
                %li
                  %p
