              %p
                has an expansion as a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+power+series"} formal power series
                of the form
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
