              %p
                More generally, the S-matrix with
                = succeed "-contribution" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/source+field"} source field
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
