                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widehat{ x^\alpha u}
                to the origin. Accordingly the composition
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi u
                      %mo ∘
                      %msub
                        %mi p
                        %mi ρ
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} u \circ p_\rho
                has a unique extension, by
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:ForExtensionOfDistributionsTestFunctionDecomposition"} (267)
              #eq:ExtensionOfDitstributionsPointFixedAndChoice.maruku-equation
                %span.maruku-eq-number (268)
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mrow
                        %mtable{:columnalign => "right left right left right left right left right left", :columnspacing => "0em", :displaystyle => "true"}
                          %mtr
