              %p
                That says that
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mover
                        %mi u
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ^
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \hat u
                is of the form
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mover
                        %mi u
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ^
                      %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                      %mo =
                      %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                      %munder
                        %munder
                          %mover
